1
00:00:00,164 --> 00:00:01,884
What happens if a spacecraft

2
00:00:02,024 --> 00:00:03,684
dives beneath those clouds

3
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,524
to land on the ice below?

4
00:00:05,704 --> 00:00:06,784
As an ice giant,

5
00:00:07,064 --> 00:00:09,164
Uranus has no true surface.

6
00:00:09,344 --> 00:00:11,364
Beneath the hydrogen and helium clouds,

7
00:00:12,004 --> 00:00:14,184
80% or more of the planet's mass

8
00:00:14,604 --> 00:00:16,584
is a hot, dense fluid

9
00:00:17,004 --> 00:00:19,784
of water, methane, and ammonia

10
00:00:20,044 --> 00:00:22,084
above a small rocky core.

11
00:00:22,364 --> 00:00:23,144
Near that core,

12
00:00:23,504 --> 00:00:24,564
Uranus heats up to

13
00:00:25,044 --> 00:00:26,924
9,000 degrees Fahrenheit.
